menu "CLAW Matter bridge"
    config CLAW_MATTER_BRIDGE_GPIO_ALLOWLIST
        hex "GPIO allowlist bit mask"
        default 0x21C00000003C30
        help
            Mask of GPIOs available to Lua devices. The ESP-Mosaico
            (ESP32-S31) default includes the side connector GPIOs:
            left: 4, 12, 13, 48, 53; right: 5, 10, 11, 46, 47.
            Shared I2C GPIO0/1 and module address-select GPIO14/39 are
            excluded. Use only pins on a slot without a hot-plug module.
endmenu
